<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage falls to 6.49bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage falls to 6.49bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage edged lower to 6.491 billion rand on Wednesday from 6.780 billion rand on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
